        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP is a 3D platforming experience built around reflexes, timing, and precision. As players ascend through a vertically designed world, they will encounter increasingly challenging paths that demand greater skill with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple: reach the top. However, achieving this goal requires precise jumps, careful timing, and controlled movement. A small mistake can bring you closer to where you started, forcing you to rebuild your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section is designed to offer a unique experience. Constantly evolving mechanics, new gameplay elements, and various traps test not only your reflexes but also your focus and adaptability, keeping the experience fresh from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP features simple and intuitive controls that are easy to learn, yet difficult to master. Every attempt teaches you something new; every fall prepares you for a better run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll feel not only your character improving, but yourself as well. With gradually increasing difficulty, each success delivers a true sense of achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP is not just about reaching the top — it’s about the journey. The climb itself is what makes the destination meaningful.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP is a 3D platforming experience built around reflexes, timing, and precision. As players ascend through a vertically designed world, they will encounter increasingly challenging paths that demand greater skill with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple: reach the top. However, achieving this goal requires precise jumps, careful timing, and controlled movement. A small mistake can bring you closer to where you started, forcing you to rebuild your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section is designed to offer a unique experience. Constantly evolving mechanics, new gameplay elements, and various traps test not only your reflexes but also your focus and adaptability, keeping the experience fresh from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP features simple and intuitive controls that are easy to learn, yet difficult to master. Every attempt teaches you something new; every fall prepares you for a better run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll feel not only your character improving, but yourself as well. With gradually increasing difficulty, each success delivers a true sense of achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP is not just about reaching the top — it’s about the journey. The climb itself is what makes the destination meaningful.</p>",
